Fixes v2's core problem: DexScreener boosts are paid ads (late).
This catches pump.fun / Raydium launches within minutes of creation.

Source: GeckoTerminal new_pools (free, no key)
Poll: every 30 seconds
Freshness: pools created in last 15 minutes only
"""
